(6979780, 1053488, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is marvelous. I think the heavy pp''g gives it a storybook quality which works well here. Just some very minor observations: the splashes created by the pole and the boat are a little too dense and look more like thick foam, and the halo around his head is a bit odd. I realize its a reflection in the water, but its placement is unfortunate. It could easily have been darkened just a bit.</td>', 'This is marvelous. I think the heavy pp''g gives it a storybook quality which works well here. Just some very minor observations: the splashes created by the pole and the boat are a little too dense and look more like thick foam, and the halo around his head is a bit odd. I realize its a reflection in the water, but its placement is unfortunate. It could easily have been darkened just a bit.', '2013-02-15 11:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6979783, 1053716, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great detail in that flower! I think that adding some splash rings in the water around his feet would have added to the illusion</td>', 'Great detail in that flower! I think that adding some splash rings in the water around his feet would have added to the illusion', '2013-02-15 11:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
