(6983060, 1053687, 62318, '<td valign="top">Compositionally I felt this could have been better. The lines of the table are nice as well as the matt. The interest in the nuts in the back also round out the shot. The wall, not so much a fan; that part of the photo I don''t understand. I like the use of color tones here, though I might have removed those that compete with the browns/yellows. So remove the blue folders, green items, etc.<br/> <br/>It fits the challenge well, with a nice sense of humor. I''ll give you a six.</td>', 'Compositionally I felt this could have been better. The lines of the table are nice as well as the matt. The interest in the nuts in the back also round out the shot. The wall, not so much a fan; that part of the photo I don''t understand. I like the use of color tones here, though I might have removed those that compete with the browns/yellows. So remove the blue folders, green items, etc. It fits the challenge well, with a nice sense of humor. I''ll give you a six.', '2013-02-21 12:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6983062, 1053488, 62318, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept but looks too fake/photoshopped to me. Now granted, I couldn''t even do this is photoshop, so I respect the effort here. I like those birds and the poise of the man. But the boat is the oomph of the image. Giving you a 6, but this is 10 material for the DPC crowd if you master those PS skills.</td>', 'It''s a good concept but looks too fake/photoshopped to me. Now granted, I couldn''t even do this is photoshop, so I respect the effort here. I like those birds and the poise of the man. But the boat is the oomph of the image. Giving you a 6, but this is 10 material for the DPC crowd if you master those PS skills.', '2013-02-21 12:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
