(6983554, 1053488, 49109, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaysonmc:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a good concept but looks too fake/photoshopped to me. Now granted, I couldn''t even do this is photoshop, so I respect the effort here. I like those birds and the poise of the man. But the boat is the oomph of the image. Giving you a 6, but this is 10 material for the DPC crowd if you master those PS skills. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment on my entry. However, I don''t understand what your saying; does it mean the boat is too absurd or did I make a bad photoshop job?</td>', 'Originally posted by jaysonmc: It''s a good concept but looks too fake/photoshopped to me. Now granted, I couldn''t even do this is photoshop, so I respect the effort here. I like those birds and the poise of the man. But the boat is the oomph of the image. Giving you a 6, but this is 10 material for the DPC crowd if you master those PS skills.   Thanks for your comment on my entry. However, I don''t understand what your saying; does it mean the boat is too absurd or did I make a bad photoshop job?', '2013-02-22 02:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
